    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36625" root="كتأ" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِنْتَأْوُ</span></b>  (but accord. to some, this is from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كنت</span>)
A <i>strong</i> rope. (K.) [But see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كدأ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also, A man <i>having a large and thick,</i> or <i>a
handsome, beard.</i> (K.) Said to be a dial. form
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِنْثَأْوٌ</span>. (TA.)

